    "document": "Chapter Approved",
    "section": "Appendix",
    "summary": "A card can pair a standard scoring condition with a cumulative one. Satisfying the cumulative condition pays both VP amounts. When alternatives are labelled ‘or’, only one qualifying condition pays out. Choose the standard condition or one of its alternatives.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
